00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:32.080
<v Tara / Journey>No. Okay.

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:36.540
<v Tim / GM>No. I think in that case, Rolan is probably hanging out with you a little bit

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:36.780
<v Tim / GM>Okay.

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:42.685
<v Tim / GM>Kind of hovering around you. Okay. Maybe trying to, like, start a conversation by, like, walking past you a couple times.

00:05:42.685 --> 00:05:43.185
<v Hannah / Eryn>Mhmm.

00:05:43.645 --> 00:05:45.985
<v Tim / GM>But like before, he's a little shy, maybe.

00:05:46.045 --> 00:05:55.310
<v Tara / Journey>Okay. Journey is just really trying to get a feel for what teamwork looks like outside of her own home. So she's paying close attention to these people.

