<v Tim / GM>a couple months ago in North here, but

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:45.650
<v Tim / GM>I was really looking forward to it. There might not be any left.

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:48.370
<v Tara / Journey>Why not get in line? She might make more.

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:51.495
<v Tim / GM>Well, This crew has never really experienced it.

00:06:52.195 --> 00:06:52.935
<v Tara / Journey>I suppose.

00:06:55.715 --> 00:06:56.435
<v Tim / GM>You can see

00:06:57.140 --> 00:07:00.260
<v Tim / GM>No. You do it. You can see

