00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.340
<v Thomas / Guy>You always tell me not to eat them right away, puppy.

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:46.000
<v Maggie / Poppy>I mean, those are special, though. They they, like, do things.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:47.140
