<v Tim / GM>He's he's looking at his cookie suddenly dissatisfied.

00:09:53.825 --> 00:09:58.000
<v Tara / Journey>I mean, it looks like there's someone at the counter. I think they're reaching for a cookie. Hi.

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:00.000
<v Maggie / Poppy>Hands to yourself.

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:03.200
<v Tara / Journey>I clap rolling on the back, and I start strolling away.

