<v Tim / GM>He, takes a look at all of your, like, empty or nearly empty baskets, and he says, well, what's left?

00:11:43.980 --> 00:11:53.195
<v Maggie / Poppy>Well, we have a couple of chocolate chip cookies left. There's probably one apple turnover and a chocolate donut.

